</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The difference between GAAP and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> gross margin was 1.3% and 2.0%, or
$1.4&nbsp;million and $1.7&nbsp;million, for the three months ended October&nbsp;31, 2025 and October&nbsp;31, 2024, respectively. The difference between GAAP and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-GAAP</FONT> gross margin was 1.6% and 2.3%, or
$4.7&nbsp;million and $4.6&nbsp;million, for the nine months ended October&nbsp;31, 2025 and October&nbsp;31, 2024, respectively. The differences were due to the effect of stock-based compensation and the amortization of acquisition-related
costs.&#8195; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:24pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B>AMBARELLA, INC. </B></P>
